## Binaural Doppler — 25 minutes
##
## Acoustic parameters mirrored from a public curated session library;
## score re-authored in SBaGen .sbg format.
## Independent work - not affiliated with or endorsed by any third party.
##
##
## Rendered with entrain's native doppler voice: both tones of each
## binaural pair glide up and down together on a slow sinusoid — the
## beat itself stays constant, the way a passing vehicle's pitch
## moves. Alpha phases swing faster (rate 0.1 Hz) than theta (0.05).
##
## A 250 Hz carrier alternating alpha (10 Hz) and theta (5 Hz) phases.
## Headphones required. Original sbagen cannot parse this file.
##
## extended syntax: entrain

off: -
alpha: doppler:250+10/20 rate0.1 depth15
theta: doppler:250+5/20 rate0.05 depth15

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 alpha
00:05:00 alpha
00:10:00 theta
00:15:00 alpha
00:20:00 theta
00:22:00 alpha
00:24:00 theta
00:25:00 off
